                            4
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَوْحَى إِلَيْهِ</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He</i> (God) <i>revealed to him;</i> or
<i>spake,</i> or <i>made known, to him by revelation</i> ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2- 
Also, <i>He suggested to him;</i> or <i>put into his
mind.</i> (Mughnee voce <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَنْ</span>.)

